{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "flyer-with-a-smiley-face",
  "name": "Flyer with a Smiley Face",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Flyer_with_a_Smiley_Face",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-03T10:35:34.700Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Look at you, following your curiosity and destiny to pick up this very flyer."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We know you're looking for a bit of comfort."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Maybe you're just weary of a life that never changes, or perhaps you're barely hanging on through a rough patch?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-85d93e26aa4b0ce9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We've got the answer."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-220329494a5b163e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't run off just yet. I promise this isn't a scam involving dodgy meds or some amulets that'll cost you 80% of your credits."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The \"answer\" we're talking about is the most natural thing in the universe, something every living being understands by instinct...."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9da57ede2b90526b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...A"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "smile"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-135d2b09c70f6932"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You might argue, \"How can I smile when I'm not even happy?\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e66eb34dc9107569"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You've got it backward! Believe it or not, it actually works the other way around."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Keep a smile on your face, and happiness will come knocking at your door."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ee5a3ce72b4c96c2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let me tell you a story:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Not long ago, there was a ploo who ran a shop. He opened early and closed late, but hardly anyone ever visited."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He wasn't making many credits, so he spent his days moping, which only made people stay away even more."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then he found our flyer (the previous version — we're always updating our stories!)."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-855003f507a6de5d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He was skeptical, but he figured his life couldn't get any worse, so he gave it a shot."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He started smiling at every customer. People began to talk, wondering what good news he was hiding."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was working, but he soon realized that smiling all the time is hard work and started to have second thoughts."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When we heard about his struggle, we rushed over to give him as much help as possible."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f66e91198c9c52c2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Soon after, his shop was seeing a thousand times more customers than before."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To this day, he's still smiling from the bottom of his heart. What a result!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3c98bfea78df4325"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Getting interested?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you want to know the secret to keeping a smile on your face at all times, just ask..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e84e37d8c2a53652"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(The following pages are torn off.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a14640f8c505d2db"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd0498e2522c8f32"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
